    "narrative": "The Austin Waves are leaning into stolen base volume and favorable matchups against back-end rotation arms today, headlined by **Nasim Nunez**, who earns our highest start-rating of 62.09. Despite hitting 9th, **Nasim Nunez** benefits from a distinct park factor boost and a high-leverage opportunity against Feltner, whose 5.10 xERA suggests a high-probability environment for **Nasim Nunez** to reach base and utilize his elite speed. Similarly, **Sam Antonacci** commands a 59.34 score from the leadoff spot; his matchup against Rocker is statistically advantageous given the platoon edge and the high-volume opportunities inherent in the #1 hole. While **Jackson Merrill** faces a tougher test against Ashcraft (3.28 xERA), his dynamic platoon profile keeps him in the 51.54 range, providing necessary depth to round out the outfield.\n\nStrategic decision-making today was highlighted by the utility slot, where **Miguel Vargas** edged out potential bench depth with a 54.63 score, driven largely by an impressive 0.389 xwOBA and the premium placement in the 3-hole. **Tommy White** rounds out the infield at 55.04, benefiting from a +10% park factor adjustment that offsets the neutral R/R matchup against Matthews. With heavy hitters like **Kyle Tucker**, **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, **Gunnar Henderson**, and **Luis Robert Jr.** sidelined by team off-days, our offensive engine is reliant on the table-setting abilities of **Sam Antonacci** and **Nasim Nunez**. While our bench depth\u2014including **Andy Pages**, **Jordan Westburg**, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, **Jacob Wilson**, **Drake Baldwin**, **Heliot Ramos**, **Josh Jung**, **Coby Mayo**, **Curtis Mead**, **Dominic Smith**, **Wade Meckler**, **Liam Hicks**, and **Luis Lara**\u2014remains available, none matched the specific combination of plate appearances and matchup-adjusted projections required to displace our current starters. No immediate weather alerts are threatening the slate, allowing us to proceed with full confidence in our primary utility and infield alignment.",
